v><ul class=\"flex w-full flex-nowrap items-center justify-start gap-4 md:w-auto\"><li class=\"_eleX flex shrink-0 items-center text-base whitespace-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/privacy-policy\" class=\"_underline\"><div class=\" slide-left transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\">Privacy Policy</div></a></li><li class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"mt-1 h-[4px] w-[4px] rounded-full bg-current opacity-70\"></div></li><li class=\"_eleX flex shrink-0 items-center text-base whitespace-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/terms-of-service\" class=\"_underline\"><div class=\" slide-left transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:200ms\">Terms of service</div></a></li></ul></div></div></footer><div id=\"splash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div><svg width=\"159\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 159 23\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"#fff\" d=\"M11.3809 6.18032V0.426371H15.1869V6.55012C15.1869 7.23176 15.0558 7.83332 14.7949 8.35406C14.5339 8.87554 14.111 9.31102 13.5263 9.66126C12.9414 10.0119 12.1764 10.2768 11.2315 10.4573C10.2859 10.6374 9.12936 10.7267 7.76077 10.7267C6.41793 10.7267 5.26735 10.6437 4.30941 10.4783C3.35109 10.3126 2.57122 10.0643 1.96756 9.73285C1.36465 9.40034 0.922634 8.98404 0.643016 8.48249C0.363025 7.98021 0.222656 7.38824 0.222656 6.70586V0.426371H4.2157V6.15191C4.2157 6.44567 4.2564 6.72468 4.33703 6.9904C4.41805 7.25501 4.58268 7.48973 4.83169 7.69382C5.08032 7.89754 5.43497 8.05734 5.89528 8.17655C6.35558 8.29538 6.96447 8.35406 7.72381 8.35406C8.48203 8.35406 9.10174 8.29538 9.57996 8.17655C10.0589 8.05734 10.4326 7.89754 10.6996 7.69382C10.9672 7.48973 11.1479 7.25797 11.2409 6.99704C11.3342 6.73649 11.3809 6.46486 11.3809 6.18032Z\"></path></svg></div></div><script>window.__I18N__={\"en\":{\"home\":{\"intro\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Leading User Experience & UX Research Company\",\"historyOf\":\"The History Of\",\"userExperience\":\"User Experience\",\"letsExplore\":\"Let's explore through time\",\"startExperience\":\"Start Experience\",\"skipPast\":\"skip the past & show services\"},\"scenes\":{\"intro\":{\"text\":\"From the dawn of humanity to the digital age, experience design has shaped our world.\"},\"earlyHumans\":{\"title\":\"Early Humans\",\"text\":\"Long before screens and devices, people were designing tools, shelters, ways to communicate. Each invention solved a problem, making life easier. That instinct to create for others? That's where UX began.\"},\"ancientEgypt\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT EGYPT\",\"text\":\"Ancient Egyptians built more than monuments. With intention and precision, they designed experiences from sacred spaces to rituals that met human needs and echoed across generations.\"},\"ancientChina\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT CHINA\",\"text\":\"From water clocks to calendars, ancient China's innovations brought structure to life. These weren't just technical feats they were human centered designs that shaped rhythm, order, and connection.\"},\"ancientGreece\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT GREECE\",\"text\":\"In ancient Greece, design met strategy. Spears, shields, and formations weren't just tools of war they were crafted for precision, protection, and purpose. A clear example of design meeting real human needs.\"},\"islamicGoldenAge\":{\"title\":\"ISLAMIC GOLDEN AGE\",\"text\":\"The Islamic Golden Age turned curiosity into clarity. With tools for astronomy and systems like algebra, thinkers designed experiences that made complex ideas easier to explore and apply.\"},\"industrialAge\":{\"title\":\"INDUSTRIAL AGE\",\"text\":\"The Industrial Age brought machines, movement, and mass production. Steam engines and factories reshaped how we work and live designing systems not just for people, but for scale and speed.\"},\"waltDisney\":{\"title\":\"WALT DISNEY\",\"text\":\"In the 1960s, Disney turned imagination into design. His parks weren't just attractions they were crafted journeys, proving that user experience could be magical, immersive, and unforgettable.\"},\"steveJobs\":{\"title\":\"Steve JOBS\",\"text\":\"Then came the iPod. With a click wheel and clean design, Steve Jobs didn't just change music he redefined how we interact with technology: simple, elegant, human.\"},\"uxbertLabs\":{\"title\":\"UXBERT LABS\",\"text\":\"From ancient tools to digital touchpoints, UX has shaped progress. At UXBERT Labs, we carry that legacy forward designing solutions that truly connect with people, right here in our region.\"}},\"mobile\":{\"explore\":\"Explore\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"explorePortfolio\":\"Explore portfolio\",\"closePortfolio\":\"Close portfolio\",\"nav\":{\"1900\":\"1900\",\"1960\":\"1960\",\"2000\":\"2000\",\"2012\":\"2012\",\"earlyHumans\":\"Early Humans\",\"ancientEgypt\":\"Ancient Egypt\",\"ancientChina\":\"Ancient China\",\"ancientGreece\":\"Ancient Greece\",\"islamicGoldenAge\":\"Islamic Golden Age\"}},\"timeline\":{\"present\":\"Present\"},\"menu\":{\"thePast\":\"The Past\",\"thePresent\":\"The Present\",\"aboutUs\":\"About us\",\"services\":\"Services\",\"caseStudies\":\"Case Studies\",\"articles\":\"Articles\",\"uxCourses\":\"UX Courses\",\"careers\":\"Careers\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact us\"},\"ui\":{\"present\":\"present\",\"muteMusic\":\"Mute background music\",\"unmuteMusic\":\"Unmute background music\",\"scrollToDiscover\":\"SCROLL TO DISCOVER\",\"clickAndHold\":{\"line1\":\"Click\",\"line2\":\"& Hold\"},\"caseStudyTags\":{\"WEBSITE\":\"Website\",\"APP\":\"App\",\"ENTERTAINMENT\":\"Entertainment\",\"SPORTS\":\"Sports\",\"EVENTS\":\"Events\",\"FINANCIAL\":\"Financial\",\"E-COMMERCE\":\"E-Commerce\",\"DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION\":\"Digital Transformation\",\"ART\":\"Art\",\"EDUCATIONAL\":\"Educational\",\"E-Sports\":\"E-Sports\"},\"footer\":{\"addressLabel\":\"Address\",\"addressValue\":\"8 The Green , STE A Dover , Delaware 19901\",\"locationOnMap\":\"Location on map\",\"emailLabel\":\"E-mail\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Phone\",\"quickLinksTitle\":\"Quick Links\",\"servicesTitle\":\"Services\",\"followUsTitle\":\"Follow us\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Transform and grow your business now\",\"hireUs\":\"Hire us\",\"rightsReserved\":\"All Rights Reserved.\",\"privacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"termsOfService\":\"Terms of service\",\"quickLinks\":{\"aboutUs\":\"About us\",\"uxCourses\":\"UX Courses\",\"caseStudies\":\"Case Studies\",\"careers\":\"Careers\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact us\",\"articles\":\"Articles\"},\"services\":{\"uxResearch\":\"User Experience & Research\",\"uiDesign\":\"User Interface Design (UI)\",\"development\":\"Development\",\"marketing\":\"Marketing\",\"strategy\":\"Strategy & Transformation\",\"ai\":\"Artificial Intelligence (AI)\",\"ar\":\"Augmented Reality (AR)\"},\"social\":{\"followOn\":\"Follow us on {{platform}}\",\"platforms\":{\"linkedin\":\"LinkedIn\",\"x\":\"X\",\"instagram\":\"Instagram\",\"youtube\":\"Youtube\",\"facebook\":\"Facebook\"}}}},\"meta\":{\"title\":\"UX/UI Design & Development Agency in Riyadh | UXBERT Labs\",\"description\":\"Award-winning specialists in User Research, UX/UI Design & Digital Platforms Development. Transform your product across KSA, UAE & UK.\"}},\"about\":{\"breadcrumbs\":{\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About Us\"},\"hero\":{\"subtitle\":\"Our Story\",\"title1\":\"Powering Business with Technology and Skilled Talent\",\"title2\":\"Built Around Your Business Goals\",\"description\":\"We are an IT services and staffing company that delivers technology and talent under one roof. From Workday, ServiceNow, and Salesforce implementations to IoT and AI solutions, we help businesses plan, build, and run the systems they depend on. Our skilled professionals integrate seamlessly with your team, so you get the right expertise, faster delivery, and a single partner accountable for results.\"},\"intro\":{\"heading\":\"Your One-Stop IT Partner\",\"p1\":\"Tuklogic is an IT services and staffing company that brings technology and talent together under one roof. Our team of experienced consultants, engineers, and recruiters delivers Workday, ServiceNow, and Salesforce implementations, along with IoT and AI solutions and a full range of IT services. We also place skilled professionals on contract or permanent basis, so your projects have the right people from day one. By combining delivery and talent, we help businesses move faster, reduce risk, and get measurable results from their technology investments.\"},\"overview\":{\"heading\":\"Our Story, Your Success\",\"p1\":\"Tuklogic is a full-service IT and talent solutions company serving businesses across [country/regions], with teams in [city/cities]. We specialize in IT services, ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle implementation and support, and both IT and non-IT staffing. Our certified consultants and experienced recruiters help organizations modernize operations, streamline workflows and build high-performing teams. [Add recognition, such as partner status, certifications, awards or years in business.] What sets us apart is our single-partner approach: instead of juggling multiple vendors, clients get the right technology expertise and the right people from one trusted team, with a focus on measurable results, fast delivery and long-term relationships.\",\"p2\":\"Behind every Tuklogic engagement is a structured, proven delivery process. We begin by understanding your business goals, then design a solution or talent plan that fits your timeline and budget. Our consultants follow best-practice implementation methods across ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle, with clear milestones, quality checks and transparent communication at every stage. On the staffing side, our recruiters use a rigorous screening process, covering skills assessment, background verification and culture fit, to deliver qualified IT and non-IT professionals quickly. Supported by [delivery centers / remote-first teams / 24x7 support], we offer flexible engagement models, including project-based, contract, contract-to-hire and permanent placement, so you can scale up or down as your needs change.\"},\"beliefs\":{\"heading\":\"Our Mission and Values\",\"paragraphs\":[\"At Tuklogic, we believe technology works best when it is guided by the right people. Great software alone does not transform a business; skilled professionals who understand your goals, your industry and your day-to-day challenges do. That is why we combine enterprise platform expertise in ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle with dependable IT and non-IT staffing under one roof.\",\"For our customers, this belief means fewer vendors to manage, faster project delivery and solutions that fit how their teams actually work. We take responsibility for outcomes, communicate openly and build long-term partnerships grounded in trust. The result is lower risk, better use of your investment and a team you can rely on as your business grows.\",\"We put our belief into practice through a simple, disciplined approach. We start by listening, so every solution is built around your goals rather than a generic template. We plan in clear phases, with defined milestones, regular updates and quality checks at each step. Our consultants and recruiters work as one team, sharing knowledge so technology and talent stay aligned. We stay flexible, adapting to changes in scope, timeline or budget. And we measure success by your results, supporting you long after go-live or placement.\",\"Tuklogic brings deep expertise across the services businesses depend on most. Our teams deliver IT services and managed support, ServiceNow workflows and automation, Workday HR and finance solutions, and Oracle applications and cloud. Alongside this, our recruiters place skilled professionals in IT and non-IT roles, from developers, analysts and engineers to administrators, operations and support staff, on contract, contract-to-hire or permanent terms.\",\"Whether you are launching a new platform, improving an existing one or building out your team, we have the experience to help you do it well and on time.\"