 _eleWrap\"><strong class=\"SplitClass alt _eleD !text-sm uppercase sm:!text-base opacity-0\">About us</strong><h1 class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rtl:gap-4 rtl:leading-[1.4]\"><div class=\"SplitClass text-balance !leading-normal opacity-0\">Powering Business with Technology and Skilled Talent</div><div class=\"SplitClass text-balance !leading-normal opacity-0\">Built Around Your Business Goals</div></h1><p class=\"SplitClass p_plus opacity-0\">We are an IT services and staffing company that delivers technology and talent under one roof. From Workday, ServiceNow, and Salesforce implementations to IoT and AI solutions, we help businesses plan, build, and run the systems they depend on. Our skilled professionals integrate seamlessly with your team, so you get the right expertise, faster delivery, and a single partner accountable for results.</p><div class=\"magnet section_ft scrollTo pointer mt-4 \" data-dist=\"6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/icons/scroll-cir.svg\" alt=\"Scroll down\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out rotate\" draggable=\"false\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"/></div></div></div></div><section id=\"start\"><div class=\"x_padding\"><div class=\"inner_padding has_border_btm !pt-[2rem]\"><div class=\"section_set\"><div class=\"section_sides f a-s s-b _eleWrap xl:relative\"><div class=\"stick_section flex justify-between\"><h2 class=\"SplitClass  opacity-0\">Your One-Stop IT Partner</h2></div><div class=\"section_txt f f-c opacity-80\"><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Tuklogic is an IT services and staffing company that brings technology and talent together under one roof. Our team of experienced consultants, engineers, and recruiters delivers Workday, ServiceNow, and Salesforce implementations, along with IoT and AI solutions and a full range of IT services. We also place skilled professionals on contract or permanent basis, so your projects have the right people from day one. By combining delivery and talent, we help businesses move faster, reduce risk, and get measurable results from their technology investments.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"x_padding\"><div class=\"inner_padding has_border_btm\"><div class=\"section_set\"><div class=\"section_sides f a-s s-b _eleWrap\"><div class=\"section_side stick_section\"><h2 class=\"SplitClass  opacity-0\">Our Story, Your Success</h2></div><div class=\"section_txt f f-c opacity-80\"><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Tuklogic is a full-service IT and talent solutions company serving businesses across [country/regions], with teams in [city/cities]. We specialize in IT services, ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle implementation and support, and both IT and non-IT staffing. Our certified consultants and experienced recruiters help organizations modernize operations, streamline workflows and build high-performing teams. [Add recognition, such as partner status, certifications, awards or years in business.] What sets us apart is our single-partner approach: instead of juggling multiple vendors, clients get the right technology expertise and the right people from one trusted team, with a focus on measurable results, fast delivery and long-term relationships.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Behind every Tuklogic engagement is a structured, proven delivery process. We begin by understanding your business goals, then design a solution or talent plan that fits your timeline and budget. Our consultants follow best-practice implementation methods across ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle, with clear milestones, quality checks and transparent communication at every stage. On the staffing side, our recruiters use a rigorous screening process, covering skills assessment, background verification and culture fit, to deliver qualified IT and non-IT professionals quickly. Supported by [delivery centers / remote-first teams / 24x7 support], we offer flexible engagement models, including project-based, contract, contract-to-hire and permanent placement, so you can scale up or down as your needs change.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"x_padding\"><div class=\"inner_padding has_border_btm\"><div class=\"section_set\"><div class=\"section_sides f a-s s-b _eleWrap\"><div class=\"section_side stick_section\"><h2 class=\"SplitClass  opacity-0\">Our Mission and Values</h2></div><div class=\"section_txt f f-c opacity-80\"><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">At Tuklogic, we believe technology works best when it is guided by the right people. Great software alone does not transform a business; skilled professionals who understand your goals, your industry and your day-to-day challenges do. That is why we combine enterprise platform expertise in ServiceNow, Workday and Oracle with dependable IT and non-IT staffing under one roof.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">For our customers, this belief means fewer vendors to manage, faster project delivery and solutions that fit how their teams actually work. We take responsibility for outcomes, communicate openly and build long-term partnerships grounded in trust. The result is lower risk, better use of your investment and a team you can rely on as your business grows.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">We put our belief into practice through a simple, disciplined approach. We start by listening, so every solution is built around your goals rather than a generic template. We plan in clear phases, with defined milestones, regular updates and quality checks at each step. Our consultants and recruiters work as one team, sharing knowledge so technology and talent stay aligned. We stay flexible, adapting to changes in scope, timeline or budget. And we measure success by your results, supporting you long after go-live or placement.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Tuklogic brings deep expertise across the services businesses depend on most. Our teams deliver IT services and managed support, ServiceNow workflows and automation, Workday HR and finance solutions, and Oracle applications and cloud. Alongside this, our recruiters place skilled professionals in IT and non-IT roles, from developers, analysts and engineers to administrators, operations and support staff, on contract, contract-to-hire or permanent terms.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Whether you are launching a new platform, improving an existing one or building out your team, we have the experience to help you do it well and on time.</p><p class=\"_eleY fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0s\">Explore our <a href=\"https://www.tuklogic.com/services\" class=\"inline! font-semibold underline!\">services</a> and <a href=\"https://www.tuklogic.com/case-studies\" class=\"inline! font-semibold underline!\">case studies</a> to see how we work, or contact us today to discuss your goals. Let’s build something that lasts.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></main></div><script>$RC(\"B:1\",\"S:1\")</script></body></html>"